-- Task Monitor seed, pure SQL (paste into the Supabase dashboard SQL editor AFTER 0001_init.sql).
-- Creates: organisation, plant, areas bf1 + sp1, four auth users (password ChangeMe-2026!, must change on first login),
-- memberships, 12 workforce people, form "Shutdown jobs" v1, 10 sections and 99 tasks (through task_create, so version 1 exists).
-- Safe to re-run: users are created once, and the task list is only seeded when bf1 has none.
-- Equivalent to supabase/seed/seed.ts, for when the service-role key is not at hand.

